# Session Protocol — {{ .ProjectName }}
{{ if eq .TeamSize "solo" }}
## Solo Developer Protocol

At the end of each session:
1. Commit all changes
2. Update `.claude/SERVICE_CONTEXT.md` with what changed
3. Note any open issues in `.claude/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`
{{ else if eq .TeamSize "small" }}
## Small Team Protocol (2-5 developers)

### Start of session
1. Read `.claude/SERVICE_CONTEXT.md`
2. Read `.claude/NEXT_STEPS.md`

### During session
- Track progress in `tasks/` (gitignored)

### End of session
1. Commit code changes
2. Update `.claude/SERVICE_CONTEXT.md`
3. Write `tasks/session-summary.md`
{{ else }}
## Mid Team Protocol (5-20 developers)

### Branch-scoped workflow
- Context files are READ on branches, WRITTEN on main
- Session state goes to gitignored `tasks/` directory
- After PR merge: update context files in follow-up PR

### Start of session
1. Read `.claude/SERVICE_CONTEXT.md`
2. Read `.claude/NEXT_STEPS.md`
3. Read `.claude/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`
4. Read `.claude/DECISIONS.md`

### End of session
1. Write `tasks/session-summary.md`
2. Commit all code changes
3. Include session summary in PR description
{{ end }}
